  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">20 higher education scholarships for rural youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program seeks to accompany 20 young people from rural areas of Argentina so that they can access higher education. We provide an economic scholarship according to what they need to cover. We also follow up periodically to support their educational trajectory, because they come from low-income families and are generally the first generation that can access university, tertiary or technical studies.</narrative>
  </description>
